Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:31:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: gate bound sessions and broadcast through durable room
 admission

Prevent legacy send and steer paths from bypassing room policy, retain bindings after removal, and report per-recipient broadcast outcomes without replaying uncertain deliveries. Covered by service, storage, HTTP contract, race and regression tests.
